<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Kimi No Sukina Uta"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Answer"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU901802521"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538283052"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>TAKUYA∞</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">那句喜欢你 今天依然未能说出口</text><text for="L2">明明刚才还相伴身旁 却只能目送你远去</text><text for="L3">思念难抑 反复轻唱着你偏爱的歌谣</text><text for="L4">漫步归途 悄然哼响</text><text for="L5">修长的睫毛 说话时微歪的唇角 偶尔毫无防备的放空神情</text><text for="L6">每一次相见 都会为你所有微小的细节深深心动</text><text for="L7">愿你的心意亦如我这般 愿期盼的答案就在身边</text><text for="L8">按捺住急切悸动的心绪 今夜依旧在心底默默祈许</text><text for="L9">喜欢你的心事 今天依旧深藏心底未能道破</text><text for="L10">明明方才还并肩相依 却只能望着你的背影离去</text><text for="L11">刚分别便迫切想再见你 一遍遍重温着你钟爱的旋律</text><text for="L12">独行的归途上 随声轻和</text><text for="L13">你总是默默不语 倾听着我所有的委屈与任性</text><text for="L14">按捺不住思念 轻触屏幕按下了你的名字</text><text for="L15">无论是我的脆弱怯懦 还是那些笨拙与不完美</text><text for="L16">你笑着说出「没关系的」 那温柔声音不知多少次拯救过我</text><text for="L17">曾以为这一生 再也无法全心去爱任何人</text><text for="L18">在上一段恋情的伤痛中 颓唐垂首的我</text><text for="L19">如今也重新渴望 为了某个人倾尽所有去生活</text><text for="L20">这份真切的心意 多想完整地传达给你</text><text for="L21">无论身在何处 无论手头正做着什么</text><text for="L22">你的身影在脑海之中 始终挥之不去</text><text for="L23">是你教会了我 心意无法传达的苦涩</text><text for="L24">恋爱的隐痛酸涩 还有全心去爱的喜悦</text><text for="L25">面对任性又逞强倔强的我</text><text for="L26">那个总是微笑着温柔包容的你</text><text for="L27">我想这一次 终于该轮到我来成为你的依靠</text><text for="L28">请让我留在你的身旁 往后岁月亦是如此</text><text for="L29">在我的心底 只要深深思念着你</text><text for="L30">都会渐渐化作走向明天的力量</text><text for="L31">若能与你心意相对 彼此坦诚相待</text><text for="L32">定会踏着相同的步伐 并肩走在互相信赖的路上</text><text for="L33">仅仅是像这样思念着你</text><text for="L34">心口便泛起隐隐痛意 眷恋深情愈发浓烈</text><text for="L35">渴望再度相见 循环轻唱着你最爱的歌谣</text><text for="L36">漫步在归家路上 轻轻哼唱</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:24.919"><div begin="0:00.998" end="4:24.919"><p begin="0:00.998" end="0:07.268" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:00.998" end="0:01.298">好</span><span begin="0:01.298" end="0:01.538">き</span><span begin="0:01.538" end="0:01.748">だ</span><span begin="0:01.748" end="0:01.878">よ</span><span begin="0:01.878" end="0:02.808">と</span> <span begin="0:03.298" end="0:04.088">今日</span><span begin="0:04.088" end="0:04.348">も</span><span begin="0:04.348" end="0:04.868">言</span><span begin="0:04.868" end="0:05.048">え</span><span begin="0:05.048" end="0:05.498">な</span><span begin="0:05.498" end="0:05.848">い</span><span begin="0:05.848" end="0:06.258">ま</span><span begin="0:06.258" end="0:07.268">ま</span></p><p begin="0:08.008" end="0:13.318" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.008" end="0:08.248">見</span><span begin="0:08.308" end="0:09.170">送っ</span><span begin="0:09.170" end="0:09.512">た</span> <span begin="0:09.658" end="0:10.408">今ま</span><span begin="0:10.408" end="0:10.678">で</span><span begin="0:10.678" end="0:10.928">一</span><span begin="0:10.928" end="0:11.228">緒</span><span begin="0:11.228" end="0:11.368">にい</span><span begin="0:11.368" end="0:11.938">た</span><span begin="0:11.938" end="0:12.198">の</span><span begin="0:12.198" end="0:13.318">に</span></p><p begin="0:13.857" end="0:20.317" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:13.857" end="0:14.137">会い</span><span begin="0:14.137" end="0:14.347">た</span><span begin="0:14.347" end="0:14.517">く</span><span begin="0:14.517" end="0:15.487">て</span> <span begin="0:15.977" end="0:16.107">キ</span><span begin="0:16.107" end="0:16.417">ミ</span><span begin="0:16.417" end="0:16.577">の</span><span