" end="0:42.136">表</span><span begin="0:42.136" end="0:42.616">情</span></p><p begin="0:42.619" end="0:48.189" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.619" end="0:42.809">会</span><span begin="0:42.809" end="0:42.949">う</span><span begin="0:42.949" end="0:43.569">度</span><span begin="0:43.569" end="0:43.709">に</span> <span begin="0:44.019" end="0:44.119">惹</span><span begin="0:44.119" end="0:44.399">か</span><span begin="0:44.399" end="0:44.529">れ</span><span begin="0:44.529" end="0:44.819">て</span><span begin="0:44.819" end="0:44.939">い</span><span begin="0:44.939" end="0:45.189">く</span><span begin="0:45.189" end="0:45.339">の</span> <span begin="0:45.539" end="0:46.129">些細</span><span begin="0:46.129" end="0:46.429">な</span><span begin="0:46.639" end="0:47.069">全</span><span begin="0:47.069" end="0:47.499">て</span><span begin="0:47.499" end="0:48.189">に</span></p><p begin="0:48.190" end="0:54.310" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.190" end="0:48.420">キ</span><span begin="0:48.420" end="0:48.690">ミ</span><span begin="0:48.690" end="0:48.830">の</span><span begin="0:48.830" end="0:49.050">気</span><span begin="0:49.050" end="0:49.520">持</span><span begin="0:49.520" end="0:49.680">ち</span><span begin="0:49.680" end="0:49.910">が</span><span begin="0:49.910" end="0:50.250">同</span><span begin="0:50.250" end="0:50.450">じ</span><span begin="0:50.450" end="0:50.880">よう</span><span begin="0:50.880" end="0:51.090">に</span> <span begin="0:51.460" end="0:51.900">答</span><span begin="0:51.900" end="0:52.020">え</span><span begin="0:52.020" end="0:52.190">が</span><span begin="0:52.190" end="0:52.340">こ</span><span begin="0:52.340" end="0:52.650">こ</span><span begin="0:52.650" end="0:52.790">で</span><span begin="0:52.880" end="0:53.030">あ</span><span begin="0:53.030" end="0:53.160">り</span><span begin="0:53.160" end="0:53.350">ま</span><span begin="0:53.350" end="0:53.620">す</span><span begin="0:53.620" end="0:54.020">よう</span><span begin="0:54.020" end="0:54.31